  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service via HTTP/2 stream reset flood\n     (Rapid Reset)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2023-44487.patch: rate-limit incoming RST_STREAM\n       on server sessions with a token bucket (burst 1000, 33 tokens per\n       second) and send GOAWAY once it is exhausted, adding the\n       nghttp2_ratelim and nghttp2_time modules and the clock_gettime /\n       GetTickCount64 probes they need.  Backported without upstream's new\n       public option setter, so debian/libnghttp2-14.symbols is unchanged.\n     - CVE-2023-44487",
